    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you sort out this chaotic classroom? Six kids, six pets, six desks--but whose is whose? Drag the right names and pictures to the right desks to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bring Your Pet to School Day,&quot; was a hit entry to Confounding Calendar 2024. It appears now as a free game featuring revamped art and lots of quality-of-life improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One free stand-alone deduction puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All hand-drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for all ages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for Deductopia the complete game coming soon, featuring nine all-new deduction puzzles set in the world of Bring Your Pet to School Day!</p>",
